xi)
Multiple transactions carried out on the same day at the same branch of a
financial institution but with an apparent attempt to use different tellers;
xii)
The structuring of deposits through multiple branches of the same bank or
by groups of individuals who enter a single branch at the same time;
xiii) The deposit or withdrawal of cash in amounts which fall consistently just
below identification or reporting thresholds;
